LEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "794049176269983"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1773783115, "id": "34157779770537194", "version": "4.0.1", "version_code": 168, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26557592687222645", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "34372843472364155"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "794049176269983"}]}, "change_log": "**4.0.0: Skill Based Matchmaking (3/11/26)**\n*Developer Note: This update is dedicated to making public matches more balanced by giving players accurate information on the skill level of lobbies. The next update will be a new jutsu!*\n\n**Matchmaking Improvements**\n- Added invisible skill rating system based on rounds won in public matches. \n- Lobbies in the lobby list closest to your skill level are put at the top of your lobby list.\n- Lobbies are labelled as one of three categories based on skill level: Beginner, Intermediate, and Advanced\n- Lobby hosts can lock lobbies to a specific skill level\n- You can check your rating in \"Account Settings\".\n- Note: This is NOT a dedicated ranked gamemode. That will be a separate mode later this year. \n\n**New Cosmetics**\n- Added \"Money Bomb\", concepted by @silver.stars  and made by Roger3D!\n- Added \"Pancake Bomb\", concepted by @sauce.nc.yt and made by Roger3D!", "created_date": 1773273347, "id": "34052154501099722", "version": "4.0.0", "version_code": 167, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_sy